In this regard, he has relied upon the following judgements of various High Courts:-
1. FAO No.756 of 2003, Pooja Gupta and another Vs. NIL, decided on 11.02.2003 (Delhi High Court);
2. Sweety E.M. Vs. Sural Kumar K.B., AIR 2008 Kar 1;
3. Ujwal Shetty Vs. Nil, 2002 SCC OnLine Kar 371;
4. Gijoosh Gopi Vs. Shruti S, 2012 SCC OnLine Ker 31780; and 5. FAO No.658 of 2021, Shivani Yadav Vs. Amit Yadav, decided on 06.08.2021 (Punjab & Haryana High Court).
